cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use CORSIKA 8, please cite the software record below and the
  accompanying CORSIKA 8 framework paper. For simulations including radio
  emission, please also cite the radio-emission paper listed in the references.
title: "CORSIKA 8"
repository-code: https://gitlab.iap.kit.edu/AirShowerPhysics/corsika
url: https://gitlab.iap.kit.edu/AirShowerPhysics/corsika
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.15525791
type: software
abstract: >
  CORSIKA 8 is a Monte Carlo framework for the simulation of particle showers 
  initiated in the Earth's atmosphere or dense media by high-energy particles from the cosmos.

